              "description": "Send `auto` instead of an AIR identifier to have the model router choose the model for this task. The rest of the request is unchanged, every value you send is kept, and only the parameters you leave out are filled in. See [Model Router](https://runware.ai/docs/models-api/model-router).\n\n[Read full documentation](https://runware.ai/docs/models/klingai-image-3-0#model)",
